ion. •	Failed: explain failure at a useful level and provide Retry only where the PRD permits it. •	Locked/upgrade: identify the plan restriction and provide plan comparison; never expose locked records/actions. •	Permission denied: explain the user lacks access; do not leak record names or details. •	Insufficient evidence: explicitly say the system does not have enough evidence; do not fabricate. •	Destructive confirmation: clearly identify the object/action and consequences before deletion/archive. •	External action pending/failure: distinguish action requested from action completed. 14. FIELD CATALOGUE — UI INPUT INVENTORY Screen	Field / control	Type	Required / behaviour Registration	Full Name	Text	Required; length/character rules TBD. Registration	Business Email	Email	Required; format validation; uniqueness/verification TBD. Registration	Password	Password	Required; password policy TBD. Registration	Confirm Password	Password	Required; must match Password. Registration	Company Name	Text	Required; length/duplicate-company handling TBD. Registration	Industry / Domain Type	Dropdown	Required; use source industry list. Registration	Company Website	URL	Optional; validate if supplied. Registration	Contact Number	Phone	Required; country code/validation TBD. Registration	Terms & Conditions	Checkbox	Required; must accept. Team Invite	Name	Text	Required. Team Invite	Business Email	Email	Required; uniqueness/domain rules TBD. Team Invite	Role	Dropdown	Required; Manager or Sales Representative. Meeting Upload	Meeting Name	Text	Required. Meeting Upload	Meeting File	File	Required; initial formats MP4/MP3/TXT; size/duration configurable. Meeting Upload	Sales Representative	Dropdown	Conditional; associate where applicable. Deal list	Status / Stage / Owner	Filters	Shown in reference; exact options/matching TBD. Practice	Number of prompts	Slider/control	Reference range 3–25. Practice	Time between prompts	Slider/control	Reference range 2–10 seconds. Mock Meeting	Domain / Roleplay typ